  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2003901",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Timaeus",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200390101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200390101": {
            "id": "200390101",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "I want to find out more about alchemy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390102"
            ]
          },
          "200390102": {
            "id": "200390102",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "The ancient art of alchemy is simply captivating... I wish more people appreciated it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390103"
            ]
          },
          "200390103": {
            "id": "200390103",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "Oh, you're into alchemy too?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390104"
            ]
          },
          "200390104": {
            "id": "200390104",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Very much so.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390105"
            ]
          },
          "200390105": {
            "id": "200390105",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "#Well then, {M#boy}{F#girl}, it's time for you to get some first-hand experience!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390106"
            ]
          },
          "200390106": {
            "id": "200390106",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "All great accomplishments start with a firm grasp of the basics and go from there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2003904",
      "subQuestName": "Consolidate - Shocking Essential Oil",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200390401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200390401": {
            "id": "200390401",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "Let's have you start by making some Shocking Essential Oil.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390402"
            ]
          },
          "200390402": {
            "id": "200390402",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "It is a foundational alchemical product. The best place for beginners to start.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390403"
            ]
          },
          "200390403": {
            "id": "200390403",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "To make Shocking Essential Oil, you will need some electro crystal and a frog.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390404"
            ]
          },
          "200390404": {
            "id": "200390404",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "Both can be easily found outside the city— What? You can't see a connection between crystal and essential oil?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390405"
            ]
          },
          "200390405": {
            "id": "200390405",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "Hahaha, that's because there is none! The electro crystal is for the shocking part; it's the frog that provides the essential oil.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390406"
            ]
          },
          "200390406": {
            "id": "200390406",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "Once you've gathered everything, try and create some Shocking Essential Oil. No half measures now, give it all you've got! I'll be watching from here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390407"
            ]
          },
          "200390407": {
            "id": "200390407",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Okay."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2003905",
      "subQuestName": "Consolidate - Frosting Essential Oil",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200390501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200390501": {
            "id": "200390501",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "Let's have you start by making some Frosting Essential Oil.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390502"
            ]
          },
          "200390502": {
            "id": "200390502",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "It is a foundational alchemical product. The best place for beginners to start.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390503"
            ]
          },
          "200390503": {
            "id": "200390503",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "To make Frosting Essential Oil, you will need a lizard tail and some mist flower corolla.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390504"
            ]
          },
          "200390504": {
            "id": "200390504",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "Both of these are found frequently in the wild— The point of the lizard tail, you ask?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390505"
            ]
          },
          "200390505": {
            "id": "200390505",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "Why, the crispness of a frozen lizard tail makes for a far more appetizing potion!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390506"
            ]
          },
          "200390506": {
            "id": "200390506",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "Hahaha. That was a joke.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390507"
            ]
          },
          "200390507": {
            "id": "200390507",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "Once you've gathered everything, try and create some Frosting Essential Oil. No half measures now, give it all you've got! I'll be watching from here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390508"
            ]
          },
          "200390508": {
            "id": "200390508",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Okay."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2003906",
      "subQuestName": "Consolidate - Flaming Essential Oil",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200390601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200390601": {
            "id": "200390601",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "Let's have you start by making some Flaming Essential Oil.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390602"
            ]
          },
          "200390602": {
            "id": "200390602",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "It is a foundational alchemical product. The best place for beginners to start.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390603"
            ]
          },
          "200390603": {
            "id": "200390603",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "To make Flaming Essential Oil, you will need a frog and a flaming flower stamen.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390604"
            ]
          },
          "200390604": {
            "id": "200390604",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "You should easily be able to find these outside the city— You want to know why we mix a frog with fire?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390605"
            ]
          },
          "200390605": {
            "id": "200390605",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "Why, flaming flowers have to be diluted with the mucus found on frogs' skin before they are safe for consumption...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390606"
            ]
          },
          "200390606": {
            "id": "200390606",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "I mean... Ah, no! I didn't say anything. I said nothing!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390607"
            ]
          },
          "200390607": {
            "id": "200390607",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "Once you've gathered everything, try and create some Flaming Essential Oil. No half measures now, give it all you've got! I'll be watching from here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390608"
            ]
          },
          "200390608": {
            "id": "200390608",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Okay."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2003902",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Timaeus",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200390201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200390201": {
            "id": "200390201",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Understood.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390202"
            ]
          },
          "200390202": {
            "id": "200390202",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "So then, let's start with something simple."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2003903",
      "subQuestName": "Undertake bold innovation",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200390301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200390301": {
            "id": "200390301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But what about bold innovation?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390302"
            ]
          },
          "200390302": {
            "id": "200390302",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "(Test) I like your style. I'm excited to see what we will come up with. Now, go and get me the materials I need!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2003907",
      "subQuestName": "Craft Shocking Essential Oil",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "200390701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "200390701": {
            "id": "200390701",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "Remind me about that potion?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390702"
            ]
          },
          "200390702": {
            "id": "200390702",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "Have you finished making the Shocking Essential Oil?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390703"
            ]
          },
          "200390703": {
            "id": "200390703",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Still working on it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390704"
            ]
          },
          "200390704": {
            "id": "200390704",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "Shocking Essential Oil is made from electro crystal and frog.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390705"
            ]
          },
          "200390705": {
            "id": "200390705",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "It shouldn't be too hard to find them when you're out and about. Gathering raw materials is a major part of the alchemist's work, you'll just have to get used to it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "200390706"
            ]
          },
          "200390706": {
            "id": "200390706",
            "speakerId": 1587,
            "speakerName": "Timaeus",
            "text": "When you've found them, try making some Shocking Essential Oil and show me how it turns out."
          }
        }
      }
    },
